## Output Structure

The pipeline creates the following directory structure:

```
project_directory/
├── GAM_FILES/          # vg alignment files (.gam, .stat)
├── GAM_FILES2/         # Temporary augmented alignment files
├── BAM_FILES/          # BAM alignment files and statistics
├── AUG/                # Augmented graph files (.aug, .snarls)
├── PACK_FILES/         # Pileup files (.pack)
├── DEPTH_FILES/        # Depth calculation results (.depth.csv)
├── VG_VCF_FILES/       # vg variant calls (.vg.vcf.gz, .norm.vg.vcf.gz)
├── FB_VCF_FILES/       # FreeBayes variant calls (.fb.vcf.gz, .norm.fb.vcf.gz)
├── BCF_VCF_FILES/      # BCFtools variant calls (.bcf.vcf.gz, .norm.bcf.vcf.gz)
├── CONSENSUS/          # Consensus sequences (.LA.fasta, .LR.fasta)
├── COVERAGE/           # Coverage statistics (.coverage.txt)
├── QUALIMAP/           # Quality assessment reports (HTML)
└── ERROR_FILES/        # Error logs and debugging information
```

### Key Output Files

| File Type | Location | Description |
|-----------|----------|-------------|
| **Alignment Statistics** | `GAM_FILES/{sample}.stat` | vg mapping statistics |
| **BAM Statistics** | `BAM_FILES/{sample}.flagstat` | Standard alignment statistics |
| **Coverage Report** | `COVERAGE/{sample}.coverage.txt` | Per-base coverage information |
| **vg Variants** | `VG_VCF_FILES/{sample}.norm.vg.vcf.gz` | Normalized graph-based variants |
| **FreeBayes Variants** | `FB_VCF_FILES/{sample}.norm.fb.vcf.gz` | Normalized FreeBayes variants |
| **BCFtools Variants** | `BCF_VCF_FILES/{sample}.norm.bcf.vcf.gz` | Normalized BCFtools variants |
| **Reference Consensus** | `CONSENSUS/{sample}.LA.fasta` | Reference allele consensus |
| **Alternate Consensus** | `CONSENSUS/{sample}.LR.fasta` | Alternate allele consensus |
